# Domain Interface Conventions

- Interfaces must be `public`.
- Names must start with the `I` prefix (e.g. `IAppointmentRepository`).
- Must reside in the `*.Domain.Interfaces` namespace (or a child namespace).

```csharp
// GOOD
namespace ClinicManagement.Domain.Interfaces;

public interface IAppointmentRepository { }
```

```csharp
// BAD — missing prefix, wrong visibility
namespace ClinicManagement.Domain.Interfaces;

internal interface AppointmentRepository { }
```
